188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (We think that organising large numbers of citizens to boldly advocate for an AI pause will robustly help make the future go better. Public pressure for serious action on AI risks increases the likelihood of useful legislation and might be the only way that humanity avoids extinction.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (We advocate for a global pause on AI development until there is broad consensus that superhuman general AI can be developed safely, with the benefits being widely shared. We are also in favour of other AI safety regulations, such as stronger liability for developers for AI-enabled harms.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
