/P 148 0 R
/E (PauseAI protests double in size every 7 months as AI capability itself improves exponentially. New PauseAI chapters are founded in every major UK city and many volunteers regularly put on talks in their local community to explain the risks of AI and recruit more volunteers for the movement.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
