361 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 148 0 R
/E (We reflect our relatively moderate demographic in our messaging. We adopt a more measured tone than a typical advocacy group. Our imagery is upbeat and we emphasise that we are taking the moral high ground and we represent universal, common-sense human values as part of a historic cause. This also reinforces our absolute commitment to non-violence.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
